    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/045c087feda52a70a4a84a1f6355909c.avif?t=1731054635\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Join our discord for info on development &amp; play tests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the post-apocalyptic chaos of <strong>The Month After</strong>, a <strong>multiplayer PvP zombie survival game</strong> set in a modern city. Brace yourself for intense <strong>PvP</strong> battles and the constant threat of  <strong>undead</strong> around every corner as you navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully you can make it to the <strong>extraction zones</strong> alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/eae4ec865bb1b8db602f6aa271ede69e.poster.avif?t=1731054635\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/eae4ec865bb1b8db602f6aa271ede69e.webm?t=1731054635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell various goods, weapons, attachments, clothing or medicine from different traders at the outpost. Make sure to stock up before you hit the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/735622d7466e6874f8c4ec9d51bde242.poster.avif?t=1731054635\" width=600 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/735622d7466e6874f8c4ec9d51bde242.webm?t=1731054635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torrential rain, Snow or Sunny days make sure to pack a coat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/5edd325740cfe39ccf985bf02e6ffcb0.poster.avif?t=1731054635\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/5edd325740cfe39ccf985bf02e6ffcb0.webm?t=1731054635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saved up enough or want to travel around town safely, think of investing in a vehicle. Make sure to stock up on fuel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/790f7b1be14b6a0c9e9a81772e322010.poster.avif?t=1731054635\" width=584 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/790f7b1be14b6a0c9e9a81772e322010.webm?t=1731054635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/045c087feda52a70a4a84a1f6355909c.avif?t=1731054635\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Join our discord for info on development &amp; play tests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the post-apocalyptic chaos of <strong>The Month After</strong>, a <strong>multiplayer PvP zombie survival game</strong> set in a modern city. Brace yourself for intense <strong>PvP</strong> battles and the constant threat of  <strong>undead</strong> around every corner as you navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully you can make it to the <strong>extraction zones</strong> alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/eae4ec865bb1b8db602f6aa271ede69e.poster.avif?t=1731054635\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/eae4ec865bb1b8db602f6aa271ede69e.webm?t=1731054635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell various goods, weapons, attachments, clothing or medicine from different traders at the outpost. Make sure to stock up before you hit the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/735622d7466e6874f8c4ec9d51bde242.poster.avif?t=1731054635\" width=600 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/735622d7466e6874f8c4ec9d51bde242.webm?t=1731054635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torrential rain, Snow or Sunny days make sure to pack a coat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/5edd325740cfe39ccf985bf02e6ffcb0.poster.avif?t=1731054635\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/5edd325740cfe39ccf985bf02e6ffcb0.webm?t=1731054635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saved up enough or want to travel around town safely, think of investing in a vehicle. Make sure to stock up on fuel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/790f7b1be14b6a0c9e9a81772e322010.poster.avif?t=1731054635\" width=584 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807880/extras/790f7b1be14b6a0c9e9a81772e322010.webm?t=1731054635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
